sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Admin as Operations Admin
  participant UI as Import Page (/admin/imports)<br/>(import-dropzone.tsx, import-stepper.tsx)
  participant Proxy as Next.js Server Proxy (/api/admin/...)
  participant Controller as AdminController (apps/api)<br/>POST /admin/imports/transactions
  participant Service as AdminService
  participant Rules as Anomaly Detection Rules (anomaly-rules.ts)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL 16 (Drizzle ORM)
  participant TanStack as Client TanStack Query Cache

  Admin->>UI: Selects & uploads transactions CSV file
  UI->>UI: Client-side file format & size validation
  UI->>Proxy: POST /api/admin/imports/transactions (multipart/form-data)
  Note over Proxy: Extracts finpilot_token cookie<br/>Adds Authorization: Bearer <token>
  Proxy->>Controller: POST /admin/imports/transactions (multipart/form-data)
  
  Note over Controller: Guards check: JwtAuthGuard & RolesGuard (@Roles('ADMIN'))
  Controller->>Service: processTransactionImport(fileBuffer, adminUser)
  
  Service->>Service: Parse CSV lines using csv-parse
  Service->>DB: Fetch valid account_ids, instrument_ids, and opened_at dates
  DB-->>Service: Active accounts & instruments cache
  
  loop For Each CSV Row
    Service->>Rules: reconcileTransactionRow(rawRow, accountContext, knownTxIds)
    alt Natural Duplicate ID
      Rules-->>Service: Outcome: 'duplicate' (Skip insertion, log audit)
    else Invalid Instrument FK
      Rules-->>Service: Outcome: 'rejected', Error: INVALID_INSTRUMENT_FK
    else Negative Amount / Fee
      Rules-->>Service: Outcome: 'rejected', Error: NEGATIVE_AMOUNT
    else Future Trade Date (> 2026-10-31)
      Rules-->>Service: Outcome: 'future_dated' (Flag is_future = true)
    else Clean Record
      Rules-->>Service: Outcome: 'imported' (Mark clean for ledger)
    end
  end

  Note over Service,DB: Atomic Multi-Table Write Scope (ACID Transaction)
  Service->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
  Service->>DB: INSERT INTO import_batches (batch_id, filename, imported_by, ...)
  Service->>DB: Batch INSERT INTO transactions (clean + future_dated rows)
  Service->>DB: Batch INSERT INTO import_rows (audit log of all row outcomes)
  Service->>DB: UPDATE import_batches SET counts & duration_ms
  Service->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
  
  DB-->>Service: Transaction committed successfully
  Service-->>Controller: BatchImportResultDto { batchId, importedCount, duplicateCount, rejectedCount, futureDatedCount, rows }
  Controller-->>Proxy: 200 OK (Batch import JSON summary)
  Proxy-->>UI: 200 OK Response
  
  UI->>TanStack: Invalidate ['admin', 'imports'] and ['admin', 'data-quality']
  UI->>Admin: Render interactive results table, error badges, & quarantine CSV download
